{"accessed_at":"2026-11-08T05:54:17.047Z","result":"Microsoft Word - DSMZ_Medium634.doc (https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium634.pdf)\nciteturn82view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 months ago; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 1; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium634.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 6\nL0@P0: © 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved\nL1@P0: 634. RCM MEDIUM\nL2@P0: Dissolve dehydrated RCM medium (available from BD-BBL, OXOID or MERCK) in distilled\nL3@P0: water and add 0.5 ml/l Na-resazurin solution (0.1% w/v), bring to the boil and cool to\nL4@P0: room temperature while sparging with 100% N2 gas. Dispense medium under same gas\nL5@P0: atmosphere into anoxic Hungate-type tubes or serum vials and autoclave.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn82view1 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1817.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); \nURL https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1817.pdf is not accessible via this tool."}
